      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nREA Donohe Spring are delighted to bring to the market this Spacious Well Presented 4 Bed Semi-Detached Residence in Popular Residential Area. Ideal Family Home, Short Walking Distance to Amenities in Ballyconnell. BER: B. For Sale By Prviate Treaty. \n\n \n\nThe spacious accommodation is laid out over 2 floors, extends to C. 106 sqm / C.1,140 sqft comprises;\n\nGround Floor:\n\nLarge open Entrance Hall (5.5 x 2.2)\n\nSitting Room (4.7 x 3.8) with open fireplace and double doors to Spacious Kitchen/Diner (6.2 x 3.6) with patio doors to garden\n\nW.C. (1.8 x 2.4) with Storage closet.\n\n \n\n 1st Floor:\n\nLanding (3.1 x 2.4)\n\nMaster Bedroom (3.9 x 3.0) with En-suite (2.7 x 0.9)\n\nBedroom 2 (3.7 x 2.7)\n\nBedroom 3 (3.1 x 2.1)\n\nBedroom 4 (3.0 x 2.4)\n\nMain Bathroom (2.7 x 1.6).\n\nAll 4 bedrooms feature built-in wardrobes. \n\n \n\nThis residence is presented to market in good condition throughout with easy scope for the new owners to add their own cosmetic finishes. Ideal for first time buyers or those seeking a comfortable family home close to local amenities. Fibre broadband connection available.\n\n \n\nBuilt in 2006 of timber frame construction with block shell completed with plaster brick exterior finish, tiled roof and uPVC double glazed windows. Connected to all mains services with gas central heating. \n\n \n\nA comfortable, well insulated home with a BER Rating of B (Qualifies for Green Mortgage Rates).\n\n \n\nTo the front of the site is a concrete driveway providing off-street parking with a lawn directly adjoining which would allow for the parking area to be enlarged whilst still retaining a garden area. The enclosed rear garden has a spacious lawn and is wide along the side of the house giving space for future extension, should it be required.\n\n \n\nSituated in a popular well-established development within walking distance to all amenities in the thriving town of Ballyconnell including; schools, crches, shops, restaurants, pubs the Shannon Erne Blueway. Convenient to many local industries a short drive to the Slieve Russell Hotel Golf Club. Approx. 30 min drive to Enniskillen Cavan Town. GPS: 54.116021, -7.579954\n\n \n\nViewing Highly Recommended By Appointment Only. \n\n"
      },
